WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Choose Take a seat from the rail on the hosted product.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.750
Choose Guest Seat. The pause before the selection is shown at ×4.

3
00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:19.000
Wait for the guest lease. This request and pause play at ×4; no result is simulated.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:27.750
The rail changes to Test funds · DevNet. The remaining pause plays at ×4.

5
00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:31.760
Open the seat menu to read its party, test funds and lease time. The copy button sits beside Party id.
